    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Pattern comparison</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Very common interview question</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Look-Alike Patterns: How to Tell Them Apart</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Many patterns draw the same class diagram: an object holding a reference to an interface. What separates them is <b>intent</b>, the problem each one solves. Here are 12 confusable pairs, one question that tells each pair apart, runnable code that puts look-alikes side by side, and an identification quiz.</p>\n"
